const e={readingNotes:[{title:{zh:"研究问题",en:"Research question"},body:{zh:"论文研究2010年5月6日电子市场遭遇大规模、短暂卖压时，日内中介活动如何表现。 阅读时先把它理解为一个被界定的问题，而不是可以脱离样本、时间和制度环境的结论。",en:"The paper studies intraday intermediation during the large, temporary selling pressure in the electronic market on 6 May 2010. Read it as a bounded question, not as a conclusion that automatically travels beyond its sample, dates, or institutional setting."},reference:{url:"https://doi.org/10.1111/jofi.12498",label:{zh:"The Journal of Finance (2017) · 来源说明",en:"The Journal of Finance (2017) · source description"}}},{title:{zh:"研究设计",en:"Research design"},body:{zh:"来源使用该事件日和此前三日 E-mini 的审计轨迹逐笔数据，并以活跃的非指定日内中介者为分类对象。 这说明比较对象、观察窗口和对照关系是研究合同的一部分；改变其中任何一项，都可能改变所检验的命题。",en:"It uses audit-trail tick data for the E-mini on the event day and three prior days, classifying active, non-designated intraday intermediaries. The comparison, observation window, and control relation are part of the research contract; changing one can change the proposition being tested."},reference:{url:"https://doi.org/10.1111/jofi.12498",label:{zh:"The Journal of Finance (2017) · 来源说明",en:"The Journal of Finance (2017) · source description"}}},{title:{zh:"数据与时点",en:"Data and timing"},body:{zh:"必须保留审计轨迹成交、参与者分类、合约身份、事件时钟、前后比较窗口和市场状态。 数据字段、可得时点和样本筛选需要与原始研究分开记录，不能仅凭同名变量或最终修订数据就视为可比。",en:"Preserve audit-trail trades, participant classifications, contract identity, the event clock, comparison windows, and market state. Keep fields, availability timing, and sample filters separate from the original study: a same-named variable or later-revised database is not automatically comparable."},reference:{url:"https://doi.org/10.1111/jofi.12498",label:{zh:"The Journal of Finance (2017) · 来源说明",en:"The Journal of Finance (2017) · source description"}}},{title:{zh:"如何理解结果",en:"How to read the result"},body:{zh:"摘要只描述特定事件和分类下的中介交易模式；它不把高频交易当成单一行为类型，也不对所有极端波动作因果归因。 它支持的是该来源所描述的经验或理论关系；它本身不把相关性、模型拟合或历史表现升级为因果、可执行性或未来保证。",en:"The abstract describes intermediary trading patterns for that event and classification; it neither treats HFT as one behavior nor assigns every extreme move to it. This remains the empirical or theoretical relation described by the source; it does not convert association, fit, or historical performance into causality, an executable procedure, or a future guarantee."},reference:{url:"https://doi.org/10.1111/jofi.12498",label:{zh:"The Journal of Finance (2017) · 来源说明",en:"The Journal of Finance (2017) · source description"}}},{title:{zh:"复核清单",en:"Replication checks"},body:{zh:"确认事件时间轴、品种和参与者分类版本，区分订单、成交和头寸字段，并保存用于比较的前期窗口。 在做后续分析前，应把这些选择写入版本化的研究记录，并保留原始来源链接与访问日期。",en:"Confirm the event timeline, instrument, and participant-classification version; separate orders, trades, and positions; retain the pre-event comparison window. Before extending the analysis, record these choices in a versioned note and retain the primary-source link and access date."},reference:{url:"https://doi.org/10.1111/jofi.12498",label:{zh:"The Journal of Finance (2017) · 来源说明",en:"The Journal of Finance (2017) · source description"}}},{title:{zh:"适用边界",en:"Scope boundary"},body:{zh:"该条导读引用 The Journal of Finance (2017)。单一压力事件、单一期货合约和受限审计数据不能由公开分钟行情替代，也不能推出一般性市场质量判断。 若需要量化结论、参数、表格或稳健性检验，请回到原文并单独核对版本、附录与样本定义。",en:"This guide cites The Journal of Finance (2017). One stressed event, one futures contract, and restricted audit data cannot be replaced by public minute prices or generalized into a market-quality judgment. For numerical conclusions, parameters, tables, or robustness tests, return to the original and separately verify the edition, appendices, and sample definitions."},reference:{url:"https://doi.org/10.1111/jofi.12498",label:{zh:"The Journal of Finance (2017) · 来源说明",en:"The Journal of Finance (2017) · source description"}}}],readerLimits:{zh:"本文只整理“The Flash Crash: High-Frequency Trading in an Electronic Market”所公开说明的研究问题与设计边界，不构成收益预测、交易规则或全文复现。单一压力事件、单一期货合约和受限审计数据不能由公开分钟行情替代，也不能推出一般性市场质量判断。",en:"This guide only organizes the publicly described question and design of “The Flash Crash: High-Frequency Trading in an Electronic Market”. It is not a return forecast, trading rule, or full-text replication. The source's stated scope remains controlling."}};export{e as default};
